# EC-002: Three half-cells form a closed potential-difference triangle
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 ZnSO4 0.001mol
add v1 Zn 0.001mol
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 CuSO4 0.001mol
add v2 Cu 0.001mol
new
add v3 water 100mL
add v3 AgNO3 0.001mol
add v3 Ag 0.001mol
cell v1 v2
cell v2 v3
cell v1 v3
inspect
